<title>USA: Calico Rock SD 50, Ark., won by First Tennessee.</title>
<headline>Calico Rock SD 50, Ark., won by First Tennessee.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, June 3 (Reuter) First Tennessee Bank said it won $1.655 million of Calico Rock SD 50, Ark., limited tax refunding bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.2969 percent.</p>
</text>
